        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Csepel"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Csepel Gallery and Museum of Local History now sits in Szent István ut, showcasing the island’s industrial past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
