      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Csepel"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Csepel lies at the northern tip of Csepel Island, bordered by the Danube to the west and the Ráckevei‑Duna to the east.",
